{"id":"behilflich","lemma":"behilflich","pos":"adj","rank":3134,"glosses":["of service, assistant, helpful"],"ipa":"/bəˈhɪlflɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/39/De-behilflich.ogg/De-behilflich.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"behilflicher","superlative":"am behilflichsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Wie kann ich Ihnen behilflich sein?","en":"How can I help you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/390571","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"(to) them","l":"sie"},null,{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Könntest du mir zehn Minuten behilflich sein?","en":"Could you help me for ten minutes?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"ten"},{"g":"minute (unit of time","l":"Minute"},null,{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Kann ich dir beim Suchen behilflich sein?","en":"Can I help you find something?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"at the"},{"g":"to search, to look for"},null,{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Ich versuchte, ihr behilflich zu sein.","en":"I tried to help her.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"versuchen"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Entschuldige! Ich wollte nur behilflich sein.","en":"I'm sorry, I just wanted to help.","words":[{"g":"to excuse someone)","l":"entschuldigen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"only"},null,{"g":"to be"}]}]}